{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42988","headline":"经杜甫旧宅 · 殷陶","name":"经杜甫旧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浣花溪里花多处，爲忆先生在蜀时。\n万古只应留旧宅，千金无复换新诗。\n沙棚水槛鸥飞尽，树压村桥马过时。\n山月不知人事变，夜来江上与谁期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}